The code uses Modern C++ features such as `std::future`, `std::mutex`, and Boost libraries for HTTP requests and MD5 hashing. It processes transactions efficiently by using multiple threads and exponential backoff when encountering temporary failures. The function checks for errors and returns an appropriate error code if necessary.']

